    "hint1": "Clear the fractions by multiplying every term by the least common denominator, $15$.",
    "hint2": "You should get $3(3x-4) - 5(x+2) = 30$.",
    "solutionSteps": [
      "Multiply both sides by $15$: $3(3x-4) - 5(x+2) = 30$.",
      "Expand: $9x - 12 - 5x - 10 = 30$.",
      "Combine like terms: $4x - 22 = 30$.",
      "So $4x = 52$ and $x = 13$."
